2. PLATFORM DEFINITION

RupayKg — India's Sovereign Digital MRV & Circular Economy Infrastructure.

RupayKg is a proposed national-scale, multi-stakeholder environmental operating system connecting physical waste-management activities with trusted digital measurement, evidence, material accounting, regulatory compliance, environmental MRV, independent verification, and circular-economy transactions.

The fundamental operating chain is:

Waste generation → Collection → Aggregation → Transportation → Processing → Recycling/Recovery/Disposal → Material accounting → Evidence → Environmental MRV → Verification → Compliance reporting → Continuous assurance.

RupayKg is not merely a waste-management application, carbon-credit marketplace, or ESG dashboard.

It is intended to provide the shared operational and data infrastructure through which legally relevant stakeholders can record, reconcile, verify, and report environmental activities.

The system must be interoperable, scalable, affordable, secure, mobile-friendly, and adaptable to applicable Indian regulations.

RupayKg is not itself a government regulator, statutory authority, accredited verification body, or authorized environmental-credit registry.

